<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 5.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 5.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1 Villa World		10.68    1.03</p>
<p> 2 Prime Credit Tr	  10.32    0.95</p>
<p> 3 Prop Income Inv	   9.96    1.02</p>
<p> 4 BT Prop Trust	     9.54    1.71</p>
<p> 5 McIntosh Sec		9.47    0.95</p>
<p> 6 Indu Property	     9.29    0.98</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	   9.29    1.12</p>
<p> 8 Aust Tour		   9.26    0.81</p>
<p> 9 MT Leyshon Gold	   8.93    2.80</p>
<p>10 Armstrong Retail	  8.80    0.75</p>
<p>11 Centro Prop		 8.78    2.22</p>
<p>12 Gandel Retail Tr	  8.67    0.90</p>
<p>13 Equitilink		  8.62    0.58</p>
<p>14 Gen Prop Tr		 8.41    2.39</p>
